sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Staff member
  participant L as LoginPage (browser)
  participant A as Supabase Auth
  participant P as AuthProvider
  participant DB as Postgres (RLS)
  participant G as RequireStaff guard
  U->>L: email + password
  L->>A: signInWithPassword()
  A-->>L: session (JWT)
  L->>P: onAuthStateChange(session)
  P->>DB: select * from profiles where id = auth.uid()
  DB-->>P: profile (role, is_active, can_publish)
  P->>G: status = signed-in, profile
  alt profile missing or inactive
    G-->>U: "Access pending" screen
  else active staff
    G-->>U: newsroom (menu filtered by role)
  end
  Note over DB: Every later query runs app.current_role()<br/>inside RLS, so hiding a menu item is not the security boundary
